    "bound": false,
    "note": "Informational projection of the contract and receipt; only the statement and manifest are cryptographically bound.",
    "objective": "Export the evidence bundle automatically when the CLI completes a task with attestation mode required: after a VALID completion, create the attestation statement (reusing one already written for the current verification cycle) and write .forgeloop-evidence/<taskId>.json. Export failures are reported in the complete result and never change the VALID completion. attestation.autoExportEvidence: false opts out; attestation-create becomes idempotent within a verification cycle so the existing manual flow keeps working.",
